# Donatello, Mutant Mechanic: "Whenever an artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, if it had counters on it, put those counters on up to one target artifact or creature
# you control." On turn 3 Bot1 makes Mox Ruby a 3/3 Robot, then taps it for {R} and Lightning Bolts it: the dead artifact had three +1/+1 counters, which go on Donatello (3/5 -> 6/8).
# Donatello himself, Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet and Mox Pearl are the candidates, so the target is asked.

